{"id":3024,"slug":"type-of-triangle","titleEn":"Type of Triangle","difficulty":"简单","category":"数组与矩阵","officialTags":["数组","数学","排序","Polygons"],"paidOnly":false,"sourceUrl":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/type-of-triangle/","title":"三角形类型","studyTags":["数组","数学","排序","多边形"],"summary":"给定三个正整数边长，判断它们不能成三角形，或能组成等边、等腰、普通三角形中的哪一种。","insight":"排序后三边满足 a≤b≤c，只需检查严格三角不等式 a+b>c。若不成立返回 none；成立后依次判断三边全等、任意两边相等，否则三边互异。","pitfalls":["三角形不等式必须严格大于，a+b==c 不能成三角形","排序后只需检查最短两边之和是否大于最长边","三边全等也满足任意两边相等，必须先判断 equilateral","返回值必须使用题目规定的英文小写字符串"],"solutions":[{"id":"sort-and-classify","title":"排序后检查三角不等式与相等关系","kind":"最优","idea":"先确定能否成三角形，再按边长重复情况分类。","steps":["升序排序三个边长","若 nums[0]+nums[1]≤nums[2]，返回 none","若三个边长全相等，返回 equilateral","若任意一对边长相等，返回 isosceles","否则返回 scalene"],"complexity":{"time":"O(1)","space":"O(1)"},"code":{"java":"class Solution { public String triangleType(int[] nums){Arrays.sort(nums);if(nums[0]+nums[1]<=nums[2])return \"none\";if(nums[0]==nums[2])return \"equilateral\";if(nums[0]==nums[1]||nums[1]==nums[2])return \"isosceles\";return \"scalene\";} }\n","kotlin":"class Solution { fun triangleType(nums:IntArray):String{nums.sort();if(nums[0]+nums[1]<=nums[2])return \"none\";if(nums[0]==nums[2])return \"equilateral\";if(nums[0]==nums[1]||nums[1]==nums[2])return \"isosceles\";return \"scalene\"} }\n","cpp":"class Solution { public:string triangleType(vector<int>& nums){sort(nums.begin(),nums.end());if(nums[0]+nums[1]<=nums[2])return \"none\";if(nums[0]==nums[2])return \"equilateral\";if(nums[0]==nums[1]||nums[1]==nums[2])return \"isosceles\";return \"scalene\";} };\n"}}]}
